		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I am a member of Shanti&#8217;s immediate family &#8211; her older sister. When I read all the memories of this community, I can&#8217;t stop tears rolling down my face. After all these years there is a strong aching feeling that when she needed help neither I nor any other dear one was near her.<br />
