		<description><![CDATA[I went to school in Shanti&#039;s class in kendriya vidhylaya golconda in 1972. where her rendering of mere watanke logon still rings in my ear. It&#039;s today after so many years that i sat down to do a search on Shanti, and I read that she has passed away in 2008.She does and will live in my memory forever. I know that she is still with us in spirit.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I went to school in Shanti&#8217;s class in kendriya vidhylaya golconda in 1972. where her rendering of mere watanke logon still rings in my ear. It&#8217;s today after so many years that i sat down to do a search on Shanti, and I read that she has passed away in 2008.She does and will live in my memory forever. I know that she is still with us in spirit.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
