		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=413#comment-3041</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[O elegant singer
you pulled with sweetest voice
at the strings of the heart

woman of beauty
shrouded with pain
may your voice resound
delighting the heavens
singing for The Beloved
who gave you your song

now your singing
is returned to The Beloved
and still echoes here 
in our hearts

soar high
fly free
and sing, sing, sing......]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>O elegant singer<br />
you pulled with sweetest voice<br />
at the strings of the heart</p>
<p>woman of beauty<br />
shrouded with pain<br />
may your voice resound<br />
delighting the heavens<br />
singing for The Beloved<br />
who gave you your song</p>
